{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-12-10T18:46:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998826720963830143"],"id":"1998826720963830143","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":226,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你喜欢强制爱是因为没有被坚定选择过吗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1998826720963830143"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-11-23T13:00:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1992578985717645621"],"id":"1992578985717645621","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":176,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实我也不想问的，但是如果一直不问的话就一辈子也不会知道","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1992578985717645621"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-11-22T18:41:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1992302383880405469"],"id":"1992302383880405469","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1109,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"跟傻鸟聊天 https://t.co/LZJJwW67a2","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1992302383880405469"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-11-08T15:48:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1987185449606279237"],"id":"1987185449606279237","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":132,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"明明是个做不到给别人安全感的人，但是为什么每次都恰好惹上占有欲超强且有分离焦虑的狗，搞得狗日常具体表现在控制自己不要有控制欲","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1987185449606279237"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-11-03T08:01:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1985255972491890750"],"id":"1985255972491890750","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":111,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠绵生怨怼，别离惹慈悲","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1985255972491890750"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-31T11:01:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1984214100931690638"],"id":"1984214100931690638","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":215,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"失去梦想，失去未来，失去爱，失去希望。\n我陷入了情绪的泥沼，我挣扎得快要死掉。\n所以我渴望一个缺口，渴望一点点的救赎。\n其实很矛盾。在失去情绪，变得情感麻木或者漠视后，我不知道我还能不能写出文字，记录下我所有的曾经。\n我不知道我还有没有敏锐捕捉细节的能力。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1984214100931690638"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-31T11:00:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1984213979221336377"],"id":"1984213979221336377","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":115,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"服下安非他酮和拉莫三嗪后，我开始平静地等着我的情绪消失。\n这是很奇怪的感觉，我在等待沸腾的开水变成压抑冰冷的死水。我渴望在这个节点，失去深切痛苦的能力。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1984213979221336377"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-31T10:57:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1984213045808439540"],"id":"1984213045808439540","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":90,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我的手明明也不小，为什么我什么都抓不住","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1984213045808439540"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-23T16:13:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1981393633388744872"],"id":"1981393633388744872","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":109,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"拧巴的人需要一个推不开的爱人 我需要一个请假秒批旷课装瞎的导员","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1981393633388744872"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-23T16:08:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1981392354864222661"],"id":"1981392354864222661","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":112,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"苦修无情道18年被查出来是阳痿","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1981392354864222661"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-22T18:10:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1981060596989907331"],"id":"1981060596989907331","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1074,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"。 https://t.co/lx4yonwN0B","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1981060596989907331"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-22T15:43:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1981023710975758379"],"id":"1981023710975758379","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":99,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"真奇怪\n大家在得到爱的时候一个劲儿的质疑和否定爱\n在爱减淡抽离时却又拼命索求爱","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1981023710975758379"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-22T15:40:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1981022786748350667"],"id":"1981022786748350667","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":96,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"如果两个人离别太久 真的已经不适合重逢了 不是因为遗忘 也不是因为憎恨 而是恰恰因为记忆太深 所以我们再次见面已经不是心动而是酸涩 比猛烈的心跳更先来的是回忆的痛苦","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1981022786748350667"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-19T05:34:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1979783196775719172"],"id":"1979783196775719172","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":101,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"嗯？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1979783196775719172"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-19T05:30:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1979782163248955546"],"id":"1979782163248955546","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":95,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不然我去修无情道吧，只要踏上这个道的人肯定会遇到一生挚爱","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/1979782163248955546"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2025-10-19T05:27:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1979781426221559930"],"id":"1979781426221559930","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1013,"like_